msgstr "R1 polja kupca"

msgid "Adds company fields to the checkout for B2B invoicing: company name, address, OIB. Works on both classic and block checkout."
msgstr "Dodaje polja tvrtke na blagajnu za R1 račune: naziv tvrtke, adresu, OIB. Radi na klasičnoj i block blagajni."

