msgstr "Aktivno (WC 8.6+)"

msgid "Requires WC 8.6+"
msgstr "Treba WC 8.6+"

msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Način"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "Isključeno"

msgid "Show OIB / VAT field only"
msgstr "Prikaži samo polje OIB / PDV broj"

msgid "Show full R1 block (company, address, city, postcode, OIB)"
msgstr "Prikaži cijeli R1 blok (tvrtka, adresa, grad, poštanski broj, OIB)"

msgid "Force billing company required"
msgstr "Obavezan naziv tvrtke"

msgid "No (use WooCommerce default)"
msgstr "Ne (zadano u WooCommerceu)"

msgid "Yes (make billing.company a required field)"
msgstr "Da (billing.company postaje obavezno polje)"

msgid "When R1 mode 2 is on, customers must enter a company name. Enabling this option marks the standard WooCommerce billing.company field as required so the block checkout enforces it everywhere."
msgstr "Kad je uključen R1 način 2, kupac mora upisati naziv tvrtke. Ova opcija označava standardno WooCommerce polje billing.company kao obavezno, pa ga block blagajna svugdje traži."

msgid "Preview - what the customer will see"
msgstr "Pregled - što će kupac vidjeti"

msgid "Live preview of the R1 fields that appear on the checkout based on the current mode. Asterisk marks required fields."
msgstr "Pregled R1 polja koja se pojavljuju na blagajni prema trenutnom načinu. Zvjezdica označava obavezna polja."

msgid "Block checkout diagnostics"
msgstr "Dijagnostika block blagajne"

msgid "Live status of the Additional Checkout Fields integration for the WooCommerce block checkout. If the R1 fields are missing from the checkout, the row that is red below points to the cause."
msgstr "Trenutno stanje integracije Additional Checkout Fields za WooCommerce block blagajnu. Ako R1 polja nema na blagajni, crveni redak ispod pokazuje uzrok."

msgid "Test KigoCloud connection"
msgstr "Test veze s KigoCloudom"

msgid "Sends a test R1 offer to KigoCloud using the saved API credentials and a sample OIB. No order is created and no invoice is issued; the offer appears among the offers in KigoCloud. Shows the KigoCloud response so you can verify credentials, network and endpoint before going live."
msgstr "Šalje probnu R1 ponudu u KigoCloud sa spremljenom prijavom i primjerom OIB-a. Ne stvara se narudžba ni račun; ponuda se vidi među ponudama u KigoCloudu. Pokazuje odgovor KigoClouda, da prije početka rada provjerite prijavu, mrežu i adresu."

msgid "Sending test offer to KigoCloud..."
msgstr "Šaljem probnu ponudu u KigoCloud..."

msgid "Send test R1 offer"
msgstr "Pošalji probnu R1 ponudu"

msgid "WordPress version"
msgstr "Verzija WordPressa"

msgid "Block checkout works best on WP 6.4+. Older WP may render Gutenberg blocks unreliably."
msgstr "Block blagajna najbolje radi na WP 6.4+. Stariji WP može nepouzdano prikazivati Gutenberg blokove."

msgid "PHP version"
msgstr "Verzija PHP-a"

msgid "Plugin requires PHP 7.2 minimum."
msgstr "Plugin traži najmanje PHP 7.2."

msgid "WooCommerce version"
msgstr "Verzija WooCommercea"

