msgstr "KigoCloud R1 polja na block blagajni traže WooCommerce 8.6 ili noviji."

msgid "You are using the block checkout on an older WooCommerce version that does not support custom checkout fields. Either upgrade WooCommerce or switch the checkout page back to the [woocommerce_checkout] shortcode."
msgstr "Koristite block blagajnu na starijem WooCommerceu koji ne podržava vlastita polja blagajne. Nadogradite WooCommerce ili vratite stranicu blagajne na shortcode [woocommerce_checkout]."

msgid "You do not have proper authorization to activate a plugin."
msgstr "Nemate ovlast za aktiviranje plugina."

#, php-format
msgid "This plugin requires %s to be active."
msgstr "Ovaj plugin traži da %s bude aktivan."

msgid "You do not have permission to change plugins."
msgstr "Nemate dozvolu za mijenjanje plugina."

msgid "The KigoKasa API for WooCommerce plugin is deactivated. Orders are now sent by KigoCloud for WooCommerce."
msgstr "Plugin KigoKasa API for WooCommerce je isključen. Narudžbe sada šalje KigoCloud for WooCommerce."

msgid "KigoCloud for WooCommerce now keeps its own record of the documents the KigoKasa plugin issued for your orders, so they are never sent again. The KigoKasa API for WooCommerce plugin can be deleted."
msgstr "KigoCloud for WooCommerce sada sam pamti dokumente koje je KigoKasa plugin izdao za vaše narudžbe, pa se nikad ne šalju ponovno. Plugin KigoKasa API for WooCommerce možete obrisati."

msgid "KigoCloud for WooCommerce is waiting to take over."
msgstr "KigoCloud for WooCommerce čeka da preuzme."

msgid "The settings were copied from the KigoKasa API for WooCommerce plugin."
msgstr "Postavke su preuzete iz plugina KigoKasa API for WooCommerce."

msgid "Until you switch, orders are still sent by the KigoKasa plugin, so no order is sent twice. When you click Switch to KigoCloud, the KigoKasa plugin is deactivated (its data stays) and KigoCloud sends the orders from then on."
msgstr "Dok ne prebacite, narudžbe i dalje šalje KigoKasa plugin, pa se nijedna narudžba ne šalje dvaput. Kad kliknete Prebaci na KigoCloud, KigoKasa plugin se isključi (njegovi podaci ostaju), a narudžbe od tada šalje KigoCloud."

msgid "Switch to KigoCloud"
msgstr "Prebaci na KigoCloud"

msgid "Review settings first"
msgstr "Najprije pregledaj postavke"

msgid "The KigoCloud price list address is not set."
msgstr "Adresa KigoCloud cjenika nije postavljena."

msgid "The price list is already up to date."
msgstr "Cjenik je već ažuran."

msgid "The price list folder could not be created."
msgstr "Mapu za cjenik nije bilo moguće napraviti."

#, php-format
msgid "KigoCloud answered with status %d. Check the address and your plan."
msgstr "KigoCloud je odgovorio statusom %d. Provjerite adresu i paket."

msgid "KigoCloud returned an empty price list."
msgstr "KigoCloud je vratio prazan cjenik."

msgid "KigoCloud did not send the prescribed file name. Update KigoCloud or contact support."
msgstr "KigoCloud nije poslao propisano ime datoteke. Ažurirajte KigoCloud ili se javite podršci."

msgid "The price list has been refreshed."
msgstr "Cjenik je osvježen."

msgid "The published price list is not from today."
msgstr "Objavljeni cjenik nije današnji."

msgid "The price list is not available yet."
msgstr "Cjenik još nije dostupan."

#, php-format
msgid "Updated: %s"
msgstr "Ažurirano: %s"

msgid "Published price lists (last 30 days)"
msgstr "Objavljeni cjenici (zadnjih 30 dana)"

msgid "No document number returned"
msgstr "Nije vraćen broj dokumenta"

#, php-format
msgid "Hi %1$s,<br /><br />Thank you for your order.<br /><br />Your %2$s with number <b>%3$s</b> is in the attachment.<br /><br />We look forward to fulfilling your order soon."
msgstr "Poštovani %1$s,<br /><br />hvala na narudžbi.<br /><br />Vaš dokument %2$s broj <b>%3$s</b> nalazi se u privitku.<br /><br />Radujemo se što ćemo vašu narudžbu uskoro isporučiti."

msgid "Sidrena cijena"
msgstr "Sidrena cijena"

